              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "20b9359def7caf4a98513931418d0c65cc5fe8d95470395f1b503ed76f9bb3f6"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-counter-nondeterminism",
        "moduleId": "counter-anomaly",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "教材输出：loops 较大时结果错误且不稳定",
        "markdown": "把 `loops` 提高到 100000 后，期望的 200000 并没有出现：两次运行分别得到 143012 和 137298。不仅结果错误，而且两次得到的值还不相同。继续用较大的 `loops` 反复运行，有时甚至可能得到正确的答案。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000026"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
